{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Llewl and the Lyre of Two Worlds",
    "steam_appid": 2672020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672020/extras/3fda9c5e66410c04c1a898d67a82e01a.avif?t=1745354820\" width=756 height=192 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Retro-Inspired JRPG Adventure</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a nostalgic 1990s-style world with pixel art, turn-based combat, and an emotional story full of twists and heart.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet a Heartfelt Cast</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Llewl, a mysterious elf girl, as she\u2019s protected by her best friend: Sarah, a headstrong teen, and Hans, a ragamuffin who needs a boot in the backside (Grampa's words not mine).</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Turn-Based Battles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat takes place on two 4x4 grids, and combined with tiered status effects and an armour system, adds a ton of strategy to gameplay.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Filled Exploration</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim, Jump, Climb, Push, Cast Spells, and Break stuff with your hammer.\u00a0 Some puzzles have a single solutions, some can be passed in a variety of ways.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Beautiful Living Pixel World</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire world changes and reacts to what's going on at all time.\u00a0 A world where everyone feels alive and is the protagonist of their own story.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Vast Worldwide Card Game</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All throughout the world people play the beloved card game, Lane Battle Legends, can you make it all the way to the end and become the Lane Battle Champion!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minigames</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From throwing snowballs at flying monsters, swimming away from others, racing horses, playing a lute/guitar hero style minigame at Inns to earn cash.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Town</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;From ashes are empires created&quot;, or in this case &quot;a small town created.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672020/extras/9ebc468b7a6ccfb8f9ec5147a7e7f44f.poster.avif?t=1745354820\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672020/extras/9ebc468b7a6ccfb8f9ec5147a7e7f44f.webm?t=1745354820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672020/extras/9ebc468b7a6ccfb8f9ec5147a7e7f44f.mp4?t=1745354820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672020/extras/958e9cb1c444db5941bd9b43856d7b0b.avif?t=1745354820\" width=756 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the quiet village of Snowton on the Northern Continent, rumours abound of elf girls mysteriously disappearing. No one knows why, or who might be responsible. But one thing is clear: Grampa, an aging Guardian, has spent years training his young apprentice, Sarah, for a single purpose\u2014to protect the half elf, Llewl, at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <i>Llewl and the Lyre of Two Worlds</i>, a 1990s-inspired JRPG with an action-packed story and a diverse cast of characters. As teenage Sarah, you'll navigate the trials of duty, friendship, and love in a world full of mystery and magic. With only one true goal\u2014have fun\u2014immerse yourself in this nostalgic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672020/extras/da46d24ab73e55e521948d7d8dd8192b.poster.avif?t=1745354820\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672020/extras/da46d24ab73e55e521948d7d8dd8192b.webm?t=1745354820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672020/extras/da46d24ab73e55e521948d7d8dd8192b.mp4?t=1745354820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672020/extras/3fda9c5e66410c04c1a898d67a82e01a.avif?t=1745354820\" width=756 height=192 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Retro-Inspired JRPG Adventure</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a nostalgic 1990s-style world with pixel art, turn-based combat, and an emotional story full of twists and heart.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet a Heartfelt Cast</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Llewl, a mysterious elf girl, as she\u2019s protected by her best friend: Sarah, a headstrong teen, and Hans, a ragamuffin who needs a boot in the backside (Grampa's words not mine).</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Turn-Based Battles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat takes place on two 4x4 grids, and combined with tiered status effects and an armour system, adds a ton of strategy to gameplay.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Filled Exploration</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim, Jump, Climb, Push, Cast Spells, and Break stuff with your hammer.\u00a0 Some puzzles have a single solutions, some can be passed in a variety of ways.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Beautiful Living Pixel World</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire world changes and reacts to what's going on at all time.\u00a0 A world where everyone feels alive and is the protagonist of their own story.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Vast Worldwide Card Game</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All throughout the world people play the beloved card game, Lane Battle Legends, can you make it all the way to the end and become the Lane Battle Champion!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minigames</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From throwing snowballs at flying monsters, swimming away from others, racing horses, playing a lute/guitar hero style minigame at Inns to earn cash.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Town</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;From ashes are empires created&quot;, or in this case &quot;a small town created.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672020/extras/9ebc468b7a6ccfb8f9ec5147a7e7f44f.poster.avif?t=1745354820\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672020/extras/9ebc468b7a6ccfb8f9ec5147a7e7f44f.webm?t=1745354820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672020/extras/9ebc468b7a6ccfb8f9ec5147a7e7f44f.mp4?t=1745354820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672020/extras/958e9cb1c444db5941bd9b43856d7b0b.avif?t=1745354820\" width=756 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the quiet village of Snowton on the Northern Continent, rumours abound of elf girls mysteriously disappearing. No one knows why, or who might be responsible. But one thing is clear: Grampa, an aging Guardian, has spent years training his young apprentice, Sarah, for a single purpose\u2014to protect the half elf, Llewl, at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <i>Llewl and the Lyre of Two Worlds</i>, a 1990s-inspired JRPG with an action-packed story and a diverse cast of characters. As teenage Sarah, you'll navigate the trials of duty, friendship, and love in a world full of mystery and magic. With only one true goal\u2014have fun\u2014immerse yourself in this nostalgic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672020/extras/da46d24ab73e55e521948d7d8dd8192b.poster.avif?t=1745354820\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672020/extras/da46d24ab73e55e521948d7d8dd8192b.webm?t=1745354820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672020/extras/da46d24ab73e55e521948d7d8dd8192b.mp4?t=1745354820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
